---
// src/components/Footer.astro
---

<footer class="simple-footer">
  <div class="footer-links-grid">
    <div class="link-column">
      <strong>資源</strong>
      <a href="/getting-started/intro/">使用教學</a>
      <a href="/reference/commands/">指令列表</a>
      <a href="#">更新日誌</a>
      <a href="#">用戶條款</a>
    </div>

    <div class="link-column">
      <strong>關於</strong>
      <a href="#">了解我們</a>
      <a href="#">開發團隊</a>
      <a href="#">開發日誌</a>
      <a href="#">Github</a>
    </div>

    <div class="link-column">
      <strong>更多連結</strong>
      <a href="#">邀請連結</a>
      <a href="#">官方伺服</a>
      <a href="#">DST 頁面</a>
      <a href="#">源碼</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-brand-section">
    <span class="brought-to-you">特別為您呈現</span>
    <div class="froggy">
      🐸 <span>froggy</span>
    </div>
    <p class="brand-desc">
      Froggy 是一隻有時候會罷工的 Discord 機器人。<br />
      由無數的 Bug 與無數的崩潰所驅動。
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .simple-footer {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 6rem 1rem 4rem;
  }

  .footer-links-grid {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 6vw;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline, #e5e7eb);
  }

  .link-column {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    min-width: 140px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .link-column strong {
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .link-column a {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    text-decoration: none !important;
    transition: color 0.2s;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .link-column a:hover {
    color: var(--sl-color-text-accent);
  }

  .footer-brand-section {
    max-width: 600px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .brought-to-you {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .froggy {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .froggy span {
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .brand-desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
  }
</style>
